        "students": "~8,000",
        "description": "The British University in Egypt (BUE) is a private university established in 2005, offering British-style education in Egypt. It is recognized by the Supreme Council of Universities in Egypt and has partnerships with several international institutions. BUE emphasizes high-quality education, research, and employability, with a focus on producing graduates who thrive in multinational firms and advance into leadership roles. The university has over 5,100 students, 612 academic faculty staff, and 238 international students. It has received prestigious accreditations and honors, including QAA Accreditation and recognition from the Crown for services to education in the UK and Egypt. BUE ranks first among private universities in Egypt in the Young Universities Ranking 2024.",
        "description_ar": "جامعة بريطانية في مصر (BUE) هي جامعة خاصة تأسست عام 2005، وتقدم تعليمًا بريطانيًا في مصر. معترف بها من المجلس الأعلى للجامعات في مصر ولديها شراكات مع العديد من المؤسسات الدولية. تركز BUE على التعليم عالي الجودة والبحث والتوظيف، مع التركيز على تخريج طلاب مزدهرين في الشركات متعددة الجنسيات وتقدمهم إلى أدوار قيادية. تضم الجامعة أكثر من 5100 طالب و612 من أعضاء هيئة التدريس الأكاديميين و238 طالبًا دوليًا. حصلت على اعتمادات دولية مرموقة و تكريمات، بما في ذلك الاعتماد من QAA وتكريم من التاج البريطاني لخدمات التعليم في المملكة المتحدة ومصر. تحتل BUE المرتبة الأولى بين الجامعات الخاصة في مصر في تصنيف الجامعات الشابة 2024.",
        "overview": "The British University in Egypt (BUE) is a private university established in 2005, offering British-style education in Egypt. It is recognized by the Supreme Council of Universities in Egypt and has partnerships with several international institutions. BUE emphasizes high-quality education, research, and employability, with a focus on producing graduates who thrive in multinational firms and advance into leadership roles. The university has over 5,100 students, 612 academic faculty staff, and 238 international students. It has received prestigious accreditations and honors, including QAA Accreditation and recognition from the Crown for services to education in the UK and Egypt. BUE ranks first among private universities in Egypt in the Young Universities Ranking 2024.",
