        "tuition_ar": "التواصل مع القبول",
        "students": "5,000+",
        "description": "South Valley University (SVU), formerly known as South Valley University, is a public university located in Qena, Egypt. Established in 2005, it serves as a major educational and research hub in Upper Egypt. The university comprises multiple faculties, institutes, and research centers, offering a wide range of undergraduate and postgraduate programs. SVU is committed to academic excellence, community service, and sustainable development. It provides modern facilities, including digital libraries, advanced laboratories, sports complexes, and university hospitals. The university emphasizes digital transformation, international collaborations, and quality assurance in education.",
        "description_ar": "جامعة جنوب الوادي (SVU)، المعروفة سابقًا باسم جامعة جنوب الوادي، هي جامعة حكومية تقع في قنا، مصر. تأسست عام 2005، وتعد مركزًا تعليميًا وبحثيًا رئيسيًا في صعيد مصر. تضم الجامعة العديد من الكليات والمعاهد ومراكز البحوث، وتقدم مجموعة واسعة من البرامج الأكاديمية الجامعية والدراسات العليا. تلتزم SVU بالتميز الأكاديمي والخدمة المجتمعية والتنمية المستدامة. توفر الجامعة مرافق حديثة، بما في ذلك المكتبات الرقمية والمختبرات المتقدمة والمرافق الرياضية والمستشفيات الجامعية. تركز الجامعة على التحول الرقمي والتعاون الدولي وضمان الجودة في التعليم.",
        "overview": "South Valley University (SVU), formerly known as South Valley University, is a public university located in Qena, Egypt. Established in 2005, it serves as a major educational and research hub in Upper Egypt. The university comprises multiple faculties, institutes, and research centers, offering a wide range of undergraduate and postgraduate programs. SVU is committed to academic excellence, community service, and sustainable development. It provides modern facilities, including digital libraries, advanced laboratories, sports complexes, and university hospitals. The university emphasizes digital transformation, international collaborations, and quality assurance in education.",
