        "students": "5,000+",
        "description": "جامعة الوادي الجديد (New Valley University) is an Egyptian contemporary university located in the New Valley Governorate. It is recognized as a prominent scientific edifice in the region, aiming to provide high-quality education, foster research culture, and promote innovation and scientific excellence. The university collaborates with local and international academic institutions to exchange expertise and modern scientific advancements across various disciplines. It is committed to enhancing partnerships with all societal entities and institutions locally. The university's vision includes achieving a distinguished and prestigious position among regional and global universities by equipping students with education, experience, and knowledge while encouraging research and innovation.",
        "description_ar": "جامعة الوادي الجديد هي جامعة مصرية معاصرة تقع في محافظة الوادي الجديد. تُعد صرحاً علمياً شامخاً في المنطقة، وتسعى لتقديم تعليم عالي الجودة، ونشر ثقافة البحث، وتعزيز الابتكار والتميز العلمي. تتعاون الجامعة مع الجامعات المحلية والدولية لتبادل الخبرات والمستحدثات العلمية في مختلف التخصصات، كما تلتزم بتعزيز علاقات الشراكة والتعاون مع جميع هيئات ومؤسسات المجتمع المحلي. تسعى الجامعة لتحقيق مكانة متميزة ومرموقة بين الجامعات الإقليمية والعالمية من خلال تزويد طلابها بالتعليم والخبرة ونشر المعرفة وتعزيز ثقافة البحث والابتكار.",
        "overview": "جامعة الوادي الجديد (New Valley University) is an Egyptian contemporary university located in the New Valley Governorate. It is recognized as a prominent scientific edifice in the region, aiming to provide high-quality education, foster research culture, and promote innovation and scientific excellence. The university collaborates with local and international academic institutions to exchange expertise and modern scientific advancements across various disciplines. It is committed to enhancing partnerships with all societal entities and institutions locally. The university's vision includes achieving a distinguished and prestigious position among regional and global universities by equipping students with education, experience, and knowledge while encouraging research and innovation.",
