        "overview": "Sohag National University (جامعة السويس الأهلية) aims to be a distinguished scientific environment that stimulates academic excellence, innovation, and entrepreneurship. It seeks to contribute to building a knowledge-based economy capable of addressing future challenges and providing creative solutions to societal problems. Established by Republican Decree No. 243 of 2025 on May 18, 2025, the university is located in a strategic position near the New Administrative Capital and the industrial zone in Suez City, offering students significant opportunities for practical training and employment. The campus is designed to provide a safe and modern living and learning environment with state-of-the-art infrastructure.",
